  know he was at a he was awake at that  time and now he's sedated so  um you know the family is in good  spirits we're honestly just taking it  minute by minute hour by hour Hamlin's  family also released a statement  thanking fans for their love and support  shown during this challenging time and  many friends and teammates of Hamlin's  have been sending their best wishes to  the Buffalo Bills defensive back since  moons of this condition spread Josh  Allen quarterback for the bills says  please pray for our brother the bill is  Daquan Jones writes praying with all  that I am for Demar Hamlin and his  family love you bro and ESPN's Ryan  Clark offered his support to Hamlin and  shared his thoughts it's about a young  man at 24 years old that was living his  dream  that a few hours ago was getting ready  to play the biggest game of his NFL  career and there's probably nowhere else  in the world he wanted to be and now he  fights for his life we should remember  that these men are putting their lives  on live to live their dream and tonight  Demar Hamlin's dream became a nightmare  for not only himself but his family and  his entire team
 

